    {"id": "LA-VN-Xaichamphone-HaTinh-z9-405-229-S01", "status": "approved", "zh": "赛占蓬", "source": "@source/7ac538a58389d347", "review_notes": "VNA Chinese 赛占蓬 and UNFPA Laos exact Bolikhamxai L07 identity.", "record_sha256": "7c5859af7787437ecb8870e9e0601f01280b086a00bb596cbaac96c1d0d3182e"},
    {"id": "LA-VN-Xaichamphone-HaTinh-z9-405-229-S02", "status": "approved", "zh": "河新", "source": "@source/a2dbf6fe28dab46a", "review_notes": "The Hương Sơn district authority locates Hà Tân at this crossing. 河新 is an editorial Sino-Vietnamese rendering of the printed name.", "record_sha256": "87a681ea1d304dcfc00c17b5bef1233c46d040dcf89c1f95a59a2053aa082f31"},
    {"id": "LA-VN-Xaichamphone-HaTinh-z9-405-229-S03", "status": "approved", "zh": "武光镇", "source": "@source/39d4010e7c445a4a", "review_notes": "Bilingual contemporaneous local operator names the district 武光, and VNA uses the same stem. Another usage is 羽光. Translate the supplier’s Town suffix as 镇.", "record_sha256": "fb4ad6e542d39cb03d6f0ad0350965747042b53f65454e7e286d8fe17dcf0d0d"},
    {"id": "LA-VN-Xaichamphone-HaTinh-z9-405-229-S04", "status": "approved", "zh": "拉绍", "source": "@source/e4616d567fa11b31", "review_notes": "Laos tourism authority fixes the exact Route 8 place. The adopted transliteration 拉绍 is attested in Chinese travel references.", "record_sha256": "369e1c561ee6a64d9e3e434df536b2b1267f59d5c85d2ed88b14cfafd6d33e33"},
    {"id": "LA-VN-Xaichamphone-HaTinh-z9-405-229-S05", "status": "approved", "zh": "河静市", "source": "@source/80b030cfcdfb9bfd", "review_notes": "Keep the project’s existing correct Chinese city name at z7 and z8.", "record_sha256": "dfb033a175314739ec9c451ad97775e3745644901bf23669a349cb25a6e42f26"},
    {"id": "LA-VN-Xaichamphone-HaTinh-z9-405-229-S06", "status": "approved", "zh": "香溪", "source": "@source/66fc29e7817613ee", "review_notes": "Bilingual published Vietnam investment place list matches 香溪 and Huong Khe.", "record_sha256": "65fd351c6219e11e2dbfe4cae49dac2bfdd413ca045747335f46039036430f7e"},
    {"id": "LA-VN-Xaichamphone-HaTinh-z9-405-229-S07", "status": "approved", "zh": "如日", "source": "@source/8c0e3ac0c78b8ac4", "review_notes": "Complete exact supplier raster literal Như Nhật. 如日 is an editorial rendering of the printed Vietnamese; available map context only places it near the Cẩm Nhượng area and does not establish modern official nomenclature.", "record_sha256": "e989f7999432f55134c6bbd25142e7100854c42c04bbe9d2a35b86c745e3400b"},
